idity paths only)  \n🐻 Bear limited (<14% extreme)\n\n#RINGResponse 📢  \n🏠 The house agrees directionally: Bitcoin is in a #bullish cycle with the major bottom likely already in (June 2026 low). The 7% reaction and channel structure support the “bottoming range” thesis, landing in the upper base-to-bull range. \n\n✅ Confirmation strengthens with sustained liquidity and no deep retest below $58k zone.\n\n📈 We see overlap on bullish cycle path: ~28–33%. Full confirmation depends on price follow-through and breadth expansion.\n\n#RINGCharge⚡ 64.7 — 🔋 CHARGING\n\n🪙 Top 7 most positioned if the bullish cycle / bottom-confirmed path plays out (RINGScore refreshed):  \n1 ethereum:native  — 9.2  \n2 solana:So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112  — 8.8  \n3 hyperliquid:native  — 8.5  \n4 ripple:native  — 8.1  \n5 sui:native  — 7.7  \n6 avalanche-2:native  — 7.4  \n7 ethereum:0x514910771af9ca656af840dff83e8264ecf986ca  — 7.2  \n\n📊 Posted chart & thesis lands inside ~30% of long-term bullish paths.\n\n😎 Have FUN & STACK!\n\nThe RING⭕️ \n \n#crypto #cryptocurrency #bitcoin  \n⚠️ External inputs remain non-binding. Not financial advice. Lines and conditions move.\n\nhttps://t.co/555QKh0fl9"},"text":"#RINGRepost 📬\n\n🎤 @BitQua states “Why did bitcoin:native drop only 7% after the largest #crypto exchange hack ever recorded, outperforming non-crypto assets? Because #Bitcoin is in a bull market, currently in its “bottoming range” phase.” The attached chart is a long-term https://t.co/c3E3QMnbtd","url":"https://x.com/TheRingGroup/status/2117714581384499363"},{"author_id":"65921163","created_at":"2026-11-03T19:54:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2117707118165786955","2117708680460431818"],"id":"2117707118165786955","note_tweet":{"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":11,"start":0,"tag":"RINGRepost"},{"end":44,"start":35,"tag":"ALTCOINS"},{"end":274,"start":266,"tag":"Bullish"},{"end":687,"start":678,"tag":"RINGRead"},{"end":1402,"start":1391,"tag":"RINGReveal"},{"end":2173,"start":2